# ------------------------------------- large raw market data (not committed)
# GitHub rejects files > 100 MB and this file is ~209 MB.
# Download it separately and place it at data/raw/BTCUSD_m1_2018_to_now.csv
# (see data/raw/README.md).
data/raw/*.csv
data/raw/*.zip
!data/raw/.gitkeep
temp/